; Larger heap/stack values test dword/word parsing and boundary checks
; Tests: wHeap, wSS, wSP, segment count, relocation alignment
NAME        LARGEMEM
EXETYPE     WINDOWS
SUBSYSTEM   WINDOWS
CODE        PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA        PRELOAD MOVEABLE MULTIPLE
HEAPSIZE    4096
STACKSIZE   2048
EXPORTS
    WinMain @1 NONAME
    WndProc @2 NONAME
    InitApp @3 NONAME